+# Upstream hiddify-core synchronization — 2026-11-05
+
+Source upstream: `hiddify/hiddify-core` `f40d9b0e2933a30788d11b4f4d8b5a17288f539b`, release `v5.5.5` plus its two later bug fixes.
+
+The original `v5.5.0` to current upstream comparison changed 28 paths. All source changes have been reviewed and reconciled with fork customizations. Fork-specific features and `OutboundStatus` are preserved. Proto bindings have been regenerated against the combined schema.
+
+## Exact compatible engine and parser
+- `SawaMEN/hiddify-sing-box`: `0dcb695697518f7999359ebbdcd0c8daf4d13e67`, verified engine Test and Lint runs.
+- `SawaMEN/ray2sing`: `c6368fc6adea94f7aa9ec57065aae3ad53343ac4`. Compatible fork branch `sync/core-5.5.5-20261105`.
+- This fixes the old AWG legacy-list/route-range, XDrive TTL naming, and Soar-key parser mismatches.
+
+## Validation
+The former parser mismatch in run 42045202830 is addressed by the patched parser. The core-parser integration workflow must succeed before merging PR #17. All branches retain their own history.
